{"path":"iterator/reverse_iterator/operator=","title":"std::reverse_iterator<Iter>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::reverse_iterator&lt;Iter&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/reverse_iterator/operator=","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns other.current to current.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> U <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <br>reverse_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> reverse_iterator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other.</span><code><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/reverse_iterator#current\">current</a></code></code> to <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/reverse_iterator#current\">current</a></code>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_same\"><span class=\"kw592\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_same_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>U, Iter<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> and both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/